# CPanel supervisor read directory

Authority: `docs/platforms/cpanel/customer-management.md`. Workflow: `.cursor/skills/cpanel-supervisor-read-directory/SKILL.md`.

## Routes

- `supervisorRouter`, `SUPERVISOR_MAIN`, `mustAuthedAs: ["SUPERVISOR"]`.
- Static path before parametric `:id` on the same prefix.
- Href params nested: `MPagesRoutes.X: { params: { id: string } }` — never a flat `id` on the route type.
- Thin `MyPage`; screens under `components/supervisor/<module>/`.
- Drawer: `alwaysAvailable` tile after Home when the module is first-class; keep Home `HomeMark`.

## Adapters

- Inherit `DATA_ADAPTERS.SUPERVISOR_GQL`. Do not add `DATA_ADAPTERS` or `Forms` keys for the module.
- List: stable mount-private identify; `{ gql, listable, filter }`; records + extras on `section`.
- Detail: omit `adapterIdentify` (`GenerateIdentify`); no `listable`; read `section.<root>`.
- Default `removeOnExit` → leaving the page drops the slot; remount reloads.
- History search: `useWithHistoryState` + Enter; GQL filter only — no client-side list filter.

## UI

- Directories: `ResultLane` + card-shaped `renderSkeleton`. Not `DataTable`.
- Detail loading: `Loadable` `3rem` via `PageStateLane`. Not card bones.
- Do not add props to `Empty` / `LaneFailed` / `Loadable`. Host them: outer `Col flx_1 pt gap pb`, inner overlay `Col flx_1 relative center`. Layout content must be a flex `Col` so `flx_1` fills; detail screen `FlexContainer dir="column" flx_1`.
- Overlay flags belong on the hook (`showEmpty` = `LOADED_WITH_ERRORS` && missing record). Screen consumes flags only.
- KPIs: shared `Stats` bound to server extras (customers: `customerStats.total_count` + `created_today_count`). Never count loaded rows. Not on `SupervisorHome`.
- i18n: `ar.ts` only; nested translator bind. Nested org copy: مؤسسة not منظمة.

## GQL mirrors

Command-copy from backend. Do not hand-edit `cpanel/src/types/gql/**`.
